# Environment files.
# The SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY bypasses RLS entirely and must never reach the
# repository, the browser bundle, mobile or firmware. Only .env.example, which
# documents the public anon key, is tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

